Not included
------------
TexasSolver itself, its release binaries, and the preflop range files that
ship in its release (ranges/qb_ranges/) are not distributed in this
repository. poker_gpt/preflop_lookup.py reads those range files from a local
download of the TexasSolver v0.2.0 release placed in solver_bin/.

Third-party preflop chart data
------------------------------
An earlier commit (2089ee3, tag v1.0.0) added
poker_gpt/preflop_charts/jonathan_little_gto.json, a conversion of third-party
commercial preflop charts. It was removed from the tree on 2026-11-20. No code
in this repository loads it. It remains in git history before that date.

